{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_07",
  "title": "一锤定音",
  "storyCode": "OF-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "907ab048ba0df9f0f0e0626e0a6bc69859a3546f6fc7b00d5aaae53f5a6004a6",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你跟在我身边十五年，什么都没有学会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只学到了一些上不了台面的手段，真是个蠢材。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "蠢材......呵呵，呵哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老东西，你该不会以为这就是我的最后一步棋了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫拉格",
      "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
      "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
      "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "这......难道是火山爆发前引起的轻型地震？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "来了，呵呵，终于来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "跟这座城市一起化为尘埃吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使现在你们想去控制广播塔也晚了！市民只会陷入恐慌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "火山的活动日期近在眼前，你们以为有了那些简单的样本资料就能搞清楚什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快速的逃生渠道都在我手里！你们谁都逃不走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "假装清高的家伙们，你们谁都救不了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛宁",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一切都会随着城市的毁灭被消灭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "博士，怎么办！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "赶紧动员大家疏散人群！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "至少先让大家离开危险地区！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "博士，要不要通知罗德岛全体......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，能听到吗！火山的分析研究完成了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果现在的话，还有机会能争取到更多的时间！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，我们已经把火山活动的原因找到了，这次的火山活动很有可能是可以被阻止的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "现在大家冷静下来听我说，只要按照这个方法来，一定能把火山爆发的时间推迟！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "我们可以帮忙，如果真的是人力所及的话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "不，这件事就交给我们吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "克洛宁已经蛰伏了这么长的时间，他的残党必然布及整座城市。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "现在正是最关键的时刻。黑，赫拉格爷爷，你们都有自己的事情要做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "这些事情交给其他人去做就可以——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "但这是我们的任务。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "锡兰......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "同意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "天灾信使，火山学家，源石学者，我们之中谁都不能容忍让有所预兆的危机威胁到市民。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普罗旺斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "更何况竟然有人利用自己的知识，蒙蔽他人，中饱私囊。作为天灾信使，我可不能忍受自己在这种人面前还依然袖手旁观！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "你竟然也会有这么认真的一面，我明白了。那么市长先生，疏散群众的任务，请容我助你一臂之力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......嗯。黑，你也来吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "锡兰说她可以做到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......小姐，请务必小心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "艾雅法拉",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "讨论好了吗？我们的时间不多了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "锡兰",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "嗯！我们赶紧出发吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "黑",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我们应该相信她，何况他们说的没错，我们有自己的事情要做。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哼哈哈哈——他们根本就是去送死！就算能拖延一时半会又如何！？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不仅大半座汐斯塔要陪着你的女儿送葬，而你根本就找不到她的尸首——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "克洛宁",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "呃——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫拉格",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "抱歉，顺手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "无妨，何况他说的没错，不能让市民们继续身处险境了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "赫尔曼",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "希望你们能助我一臂之力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
